bout this you can  you can talk about anything and you know  i will i will answer the questions as  best as i can but he didn't sit down to  talk about uh misinformation but it is  still an issue and you know they're kind  of related because the virtual office  may be what we go to if misinformation  on vaccines means the virus continues to  spread well just to study tony from  harvard in northwestern it's very  interesting i think that's very  interesting that the people who rely on  facebook  are are less vaccinated than other  people and it's a very small group of  people that are putting out the  misinformation but it's getting out and  i think it's frustrating that facebook  doesn't really give the numbers on that  yeah and you know they're they're such a  huge company they're so talented they're  so smart it seems like we could get that  it is also a very old problem right the  misinformation can travel around the  world by the time truth puts on its  pants yeah

